# A tiny Spanish dictionary for the spelling tests (tests/suites/text.js): loaded by the same path as the real ones
# (features/document/spelling.js useDictionary), so the suite needs no dictionary from the network.
SET UTF-8
TRY aeoisnrtlcdumpbgvyqhfzjñxkwáéíóú
SFX S Y 2
SFX S 0 s [aeiouáéíóú]
SFX S 0 es [^aeiouáéíóú]
